  [ 17] pusharglistnoret 1 ...................... <marker(0)>
  [ 19] extcall 3 ............................... go(marker(0))
  [ 21] jmp [ 37]
  [ 24] pushzero ................................ <0>
  [ 25] pusharglist 1 ........................... <0>
  [ 27] extcall 2 ............................... <marker(0)>
